    Bug 1973338 - Port bug 1789579: Update caption buttons to use Fluent-style icons on Windows 11. r=aleca


    Also ported bug 1973127 - Implement an env(hairline) that CSS can use to round things to device pixels, and use it for the Windows titlebar buttons.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D254600

